          <!-- Decorative line -->
          <div
            class="absolute left-5 top-5 h-12 w-12 border-l border-t border-[#F2A06F]/60
            sm:left-8 sm:top-8 sm:h-16 sm:w-16"
          ></div>


          <!-- Azu portrait -->
          <img
            src="/images/azu.jpg"
            alt="Azu, private caregiver in Tokyo and Kanagawa"
            class="relative z-10 h-[82%] w-[82%] object-contain"
          />


          <!-- Decorative line -->
          <div
            class="absolute bottom-5 right-5 h-12 w-12 border-b border-r border-[#F2A06F]/60
            sm:bottom-8 sm:right-8 sm:h-16 sm:w-16"
          ></div>

        </div>


        <!-- Small accent square -->
        <div
          class="absolute -bottom-4 right-[3%] h-16 w-16 border border-[#F2A06F]/50
          sm:-bottom-6 sm:-right-2 sm:h-20 sm:w-20
          lg:-right-6 lg:h-24 lg:w-24"
        ></div>

      </div>


      <!-- Introduction -->
      <div class="lg:pl-8">

        <p
          class="max-w-2xl font-serif text-2xl font-semibold leading-relaxed text-[#2B211C]
          sm:text-3xl
          md:text-2xl"
        >
          A Caregiver, an Educator, and a trusted presence.
        </p>


        <div
          class="mt-7 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#68584D]
          sm:mt-8 sm:space-y-5 sm:text-base sm:leading-8"
        >

          <p>
            Originally from France, I have always had a curious,
            compassionate, and adventurous spirit. Growing up in a
            multicultural environment taught me to appreciate different
            ways of thinking, communicating, and living.
          </p>


          <p>
            I have spent more than ten years working with children,
            from teaching assistant and lead teacher to Headmaster,
            as well as through private tutoring and childcare.
          </p>


          <p>
            Over time, I realised that the kind of care I wanted to offer
            went beyond the school environment. My interest in child
            psychology and neuroscience has encouraged me to look more
            deeply at how children develop, communicate, and experience
            the world around them. I wanted to create a more personal
            space where children could feel understood, supported,
            and free to be themselves.
          </p>

        </div>


        <!-- Values -->
        <div
          class="mt-9 border-t border-[#E7D6C7] pt-7
          sm:mt-11 sm:pt-8
          md:mt-12 md:pt-9"
        >

          <p
            class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#C96F3D]
            sm:text-xs sm:tracking-[0.28em]"
