                French · English · Japanese
              </p>
            </div>


            <!-- Based in -->
            <div>
              <p
                class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#C96F3D]
                sm:text-xs sm:tracking-[0.18em]"
              >
                Based in
              </p>

              <p
                class="mt-2 text-xs text-[#68584D]
                sm:text-sm"
              >
                Tokyo · Kanagawa
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div
            class="mt-7 max-w-3xl
            sm:mt-9"
          >

            <p
              class="text-sm leading-7 text-[#68584D]
              sm:text-base sm:leading-8"
            >
              Outside of childcare, I have a passion for travelling
              and cooking. I love bringing music into everyday life,
              and when I need time to relax, I enjoy taking care of
              my plants and playing video games.
            </p>


            <p
              class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#68584D]
              sm:mt-5 sm:text-base sm:leading-8"
